 "remarks": "Like-new, intown luxury living with every convenience at your doorstep. This standalone rear unit offers exceptional privacy, 4 bedrooms, 3.5 baths, and a private elevator serving all levels. The chef's kitchen is a true highlight-high-end appliances, generous prep space, custom cabinetry, and a seamless flow into the main living areas for effortless entertaining. Bright, open rooms, modern finishes, and turnkey condition make it an easy move-in. A spacious, carpeted finished attic adds tremendous flexibility, offering abundant storage and endless possibilities for an office, rec room, gym, or creative space. The 1,200 SF basement is wide-open and just waiting to be finished to suit your needs! A whole-house generator provides year-round peace of mind. A rare combination of size, comfort, and walkable access to shops, dining, and transit-perfect for low-maintenance living without sacrificing style or location.",
